  "standard": "MIP-0018 (MIP PR #325), mips/mip-0018-on-chain-token-metadata.md @ 37a3471, on the UC-1 layout (an amendment in development: 2-byte little-endian val-len at offset 66, value from offset 68, packages of 256·k bytes under the Multi-Part Event rule; see TOKEN-METADATA.md); event name \"mip-0018:token-metadata[v1]\". A consumer IGNORES every other name, including this repository's pre-MIP \"TokenMetadata\" and the #315 draft placeholder \"mip-xxxx:token-metadata[v1]\" that the Stagenet reference set in fixtures/stagenet/ was deployed with (MIP sections 1 and 8).",
  "source": "the generated MIP-18 contracts (contracts/generated/*18.compact, compactc 0.34.0) executed in the Compact simulator (@midnight-ntwrk/compact-runtime 0.19.0); the negative corpus from contracts/probe/MetadataProbe.compact",
